# Reverse-engineering and debugging tooling.
#
# The Frida instrumentation, its captures and any BLE snoop logs are research
# apparatus, not part of the shipped work. They also contain live cryptographic
# material from a real component (Diffie-Hellman keys, the derived session key,
# decrypted frames). Everything worth keeping from them lives in the code and
# tests as known-answer vectors, and in PROTOCOL.md as prose.
tools/
*.jsonl
*.btsnoop
btsnoop_hci.log
axs-capture*
*-bugreport.zip

# Device captures exported by the CLI/demo (`--out capture.json`)
capture*.json
*.capture.json

# Signing material and app packages
*.keystore
*.jks
*.apk
*.aab

